e": "Russia / School Standoff", "segment_description": "(Sebastian: Brian Williams) Report introduced. \n (Beslan, Russia: Jim Maceda) The tragic end to the siege at a school in Beslan, Russia, where hundreds of hostages were killed by rebels from Chechnya, featured; scenes shown of children fleeing as shots are fired, soldiers surrounding the building, burned bodies in the ruins, grieving relatives. [ITN\u2019s Julian MANYON&#134;- details the scene at the school.] [SURVIVOR {thru translator}&nbsp- describes a suicide bombing inside the school.] Confirmation that some of the dead rebels are Arabs noted.", "segment_duration": 270, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63090.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764473, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764471, "segment_id": "93aJCgK6zQ", "segment_broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "segment_title": "Hurricane Frances / Florida", "segment_description": "(Sebastian: Brian Williams) Reports introduced.   (Melbourne, Florida: Robert Hager) Concern about Hurricane Frances as it approaches Florida featured; scenes shown of people evacuating, boarded-up buildings, a crowded shelter; details given of flight delays, gas shortages. [EVACUEES \u2013 comment.] [NBC\u2019s Al ROKER, Governor Jeb BUSH \u2013 comment on expected landfall time & rainfall.]   (Kissimmee, Florida; Martin Savidge) The potential impact on Kissimmee, Florida, of Frances arriving in the aftermath of Hurricane Charley featured; scenes shown of damage from Charley. [Osceola County manager Edwin HUNZEKER&#134;- points out damage.] [Kissimmee residents Dawn SPROUSE&#134;, Francis & Marian ZAVALLOS&#134;, Richard TOSCANO&#134;- comment.]", "segment_duration": 270, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63360.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764474, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764471, "segment_id": "rbNQcK5G13", "segment_broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Sebastian: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63630.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764475, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "broadcast_date": "2004-09-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 764471, "segment_id": "nRcf4P7DiX", "segment_broadcast_id": "mcis8kUfpb", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Maalox; Swiffer; Viactiv; Imitrex; \"Dateline.\")", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 140, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63650.0", "legacy_segment_id": 764476, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": nul